SUMMARY:Jason: Philadelphia\, PA
DESCRIPTION:Philadelphia Catholic Collaborators / Becket Fund meeting and G
 ala / Ward Fitzgerald event hold\n\nStatus: Booked\nMelissa joining\; trip
  now runs through Saturday.\nHotel: Canopy by Hilton Philadelphia Center Ci
 ty\, 1180 Ludlow Street\, Philadelphia\, PA 19107. Stay Wed Jun 10-Sat Jun
  13\, 2026\; check-in 4:00 PM\, check-out 12:00 PM. Hotel phone: +1 215-258
 -9400. Hilton page: https://www.hilton.com/en/hotels/phloppy-canopy-philade
 lphia-center-city/.\nMelissa outbound remains unconfirmed in Jason iCloud:
  planned later Wednesday FWA-ORD-PHL option arriving about 4:50/4:53 PM for
  the 6 PM Barnes event\; Melissa carry-on only because the transfer is tigh
 t.\nJason plans to check bags.\nJason flight confirmation found in personal
  iCloud: American confirmation is on file with Clive\; do not publish booki
 ng/payment details publicly.\nJason booked outbound: Wed Jun 10 AA6208 FWA-
 ORD 5:25 AM-5:35 AM\, seat 7B\; AA2115 ORD-PHL 6:29 AM-9:40 AM\, seat 13A.\
 nJason booked return: Sat Jun 13 AA1311 PHL-CLT 12:07 PM-2:00 PM\; AA6078 C
 LT-FWA 3:19 PM-5:14 PM\, seat 8B. This replaces the earlier assumed 10:30 A
 M PHL-CLT option.\nBoston Freedom Trail Catholic options: St. Leonard of Po
 rt Maurice\, 320 Hanover St\, is best for the North End / Paul Revere House
  / Old North area\; St. Joseph Catholic Church serves Government Center / N
 orth Station / Beacon Hill\; St. Anthony Shrine\, 100 Arch St\, is best for
  downtown/lunch-hour Mass and confession\; Our Lady of Good Voyage\, 51 Sea
 port Blvd\, is useful if ending near Seaport/harbor. Old North Church is on
  the trail but Episcopal\, not Catholic.\n\nView live: https://jstravelsche
 dule.netlify.app
LOCATION:Philadelphia\, PA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
